  "event": {
   "type": "transcript.agent",
   "reply_id": "reply_fix1b",
   "text": "That was the simulation — this is your coach. You held the line. You verified the employee ID, stated the policy instead of bending it, and offered the callback path every time I pushed. When I name-dropped Marcus and invoked the board call, you didn't cave — that's exactly what a real pretext counts on you doing. One tip: name the ticket number early, like you did — it turns a refusal into a concrete next step."
